# terminal.d/data/configs.list
# Per-tool configuration files.
#
# NOTE: these point at github.com/karnull/dotfiles. Every entry is probed with
# a HEAD request before anything is written, so rows whose source does not
# exist yet simply show as "missing" instead of installing junk. Update the
# URLs here as the dotfiles repo takes shape -- nothing else needs to change.
#
# name | url | destination | description
nvim      | https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karnull/dotfiles/main/nvim/init.lua        | $HOME/.config/nvim/init.lua       | neovim entrypoint
tmux      | https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karnull/dotfiles/main/tmux/tmux.conf       | $HOME/.tmux.conf                  | tmux bindings and status line
alacritty | https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karnull/dotfiles/main/alacritty/alacritty.toml | $HOME/.config/alacritty/alacritty.toml | terminal colours and font
starship  | https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karnull/dotfiles/main/starship/starship.toml   | $HOME/.config/starship.toml       | prompt layout
zsh       | https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karnull/dotfiles/main/zsh/zshrc            | $HOME/.zshrc                      | shell aliases and options
git       | https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karnull/dotfiles/main/git/gitconfig        | $HOME/.gitconfig                  | git identity and aliases
